- [ ] Would an agent reading this continue the work without the full conversation?
- [ ] Exact observed paths and the workspace are preserved, with host and virtual paths distinguished rather than guessed
- [ ] All decisions include rationale (why, not just what)
- [ ] No unnecessary output dumps or credentials; decisive short diagnostic evidence is retained
- [ ] Token count is under 2000
</quality_check>

